@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy"; }
<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand">Your information</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Privacy, by design.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-muted">Tenant records will be available only to the authorized requester and building management. Sharing an office number does not grant someone access to another person's requests.</p>
    <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Live tenant enrollment and payments require building management activation. When the office assistant is available, OpenAI processes your question, earlier messages in the same conversation and matching published guidance for your selected public or tenant scope. Avoid passwords, payment details and sensitive personal information. Enabled follow-up conversations are available for up to six questions, thirty minutes of inactivity or two hours total. Expired messages are removed from server memory within a minute; a server restart clears them. Start fresh to change scope. An essential, HTTP-only browser cookie identifies your temporary conversation session and expires after two hours. The application does not write raw chat transcripts to the database. Prepared maintenance drafts and confirmation records are stored securely. A draft expires after ten minutes unless you revise it; expiry prevents submission and does not delete its record. Confirmed requests and comments become part of your maintenance history.</p>
    <p class="mt-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Your theme choice is stored on this device in a preference cookie and, when available, browser storage. It is used only to remember System, Light or Dark appearance.</p>
    <a href="/" class="mt-8 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center font-medium text-brand underline underline-offset-4">Back to Allen Xenia Office</a>
</section>
